          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Educational simulator — virtual money only"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "token",
              "attrs": {
                "name": "site.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " is a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "stock-market simulator built for education",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". All trading inside the Service is performed with "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "virtual money",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". No real securities are traded, and no real funds are ever deposited, held, or withdrawn. Simulated balances, profits, and losses have "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "no monetary value",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2,
            "anchor": "not-investment-advice"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Not investment advice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Nothing in "
            },
            {
              "type": "token",
              "attrs": {
                "name": "site.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — including prices, charts, tools, lessons, quizzes, leaderboards, or any output — is investment, financial, legal, or tax advice, or a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any security. Content is for general education and illustration only."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2,
            "anchor": "not-a-broker-or-adviser"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Not a broker or adviser"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "token",
              "attrs": {
                "name": "site.company"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " is not a stock broker, exchange, depository participant, research analyst, or investment adviser, and is not registered with SEBI or any other regulator. "
            },
            {
              "type": "token",
              "attrs": {
                "name": "site.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " does not facilitate real securities transactions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2,
            "anchor": "markets-carry-real-risk"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Markets carry real risk"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Investing and trading in real securities involves substantial risk, including the possible loss of your entire capital. Past performance — real or simulated — is not indicative of future results. Simulated results have inherent limitations and may not reflect real-market conditions such as slippage, liquidity, latency, and order rejection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2,
            "anchor": "do-your-own-research"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do your own research"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Before making any real investment, conduct your own due diligence and consult a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SEBI-registered investment adviser",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". You are solely responsible for your real-world financial decisions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2,
            "anchor": "data-accuracy"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Data accuracy"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Market data is sourced from third parties and may be delayed, incomplete, or inaccurate. We make no warranty as to its accuracy or availability."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By using "
            },
            {
              "type": "token",
              "attrs": {
                "name": "site.name"
              }
            },
